# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ELIMINATION LIST: files git must never save or upload
#  Anything matching a line below stays only on this computer.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets: keys, tokens, passwords, credentials ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
*.ppk
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
.netrc
.npmrc
.git-credentials
*secret*
*secrets*
*credential*
*password*
*passwd*
*token*

# ── Personal finance data exported from the app (Export / Sync) ──
# These contain real transactions, so they must stay private.
twosome_*.json
twosome_*.csv
*.csv

# ── Backups and local copies ──
*.bak
*.backup
*backup*
*.old

# ── System, editor and tool files ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
node_modules/
